Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Insumo temporal",
  "unitOfMeasure": "kg",
  "minimumStock": 5
}

###

PUT {{PeriquitoManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ingredients/{{IngredientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
